| !Run for !GTKThemeTest - riscos-gtk: every common GTK 3 widget in the RISCOS theme
| A UnixLib program converted to Absolute (AIF), statically linked with GTK
| 3.24.41 and riscos-gtk's RISC OS GDK backend: it needs SharedUnixLibrary
| and ARMEABISupport (PackMan). It runs as a normal Wimp task.
Set GTKThemeTest$Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error GTKThemeTest needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error GTKThemeTest needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 IfThere System:Modules.PThrTicker Then RMLoad System:Modules.PThrTicker
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 RMLoad <GTKThemeTest$Dir>.PThrTicker
| The font cache goes in the scrap directory.
CDir <Wimp$ScrapDir>.GTKThemeTest
| The C heap goes in a dynamic area; the WimpSlot holds the program.
WimpSlot -min @SLOT@K -max @SLOT@K
| Paths for the program are UnixLib paths, /<Var$Dir>/..., not expanded
| here. Its messages go to <Wimp$ScrapDir>.GTKThemeTest.Log.
Run <GTKThemeTest$Dir>.themetest /<GTKThemeTest$Dir> /<Wimp$ScrapDir>/GTKThemeTest/Log
